图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Context window optimization for DeepSeek Harness agents. Sandboxes tool output in-process (only what you print enters the conversation), persists session memory in an FTS5 knowledge base, and enforces routing via a system-prompt routing section.","id":"gh:1362304285","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-context-mode","slug":"icanfinish11/dsh-context-mode","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Context window optimization for DeepSeek Harness agents. Sandboxes tool output in-process (only what"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" you print enters the conversation), persists session memory in an FTS5 knowledge base, and enforces"},{"id":"p1s3","text":" routing via a system-prompt routing section."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-context-mode"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Context Mode (the MCP server that keeps raw data out of the context window) as\na self-contained **De"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"epSeek Harness** plugin package. This folder is its own\nnpm package (`package.json` declares `dsh.bu"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"ndle`), so it installs and\npublishes independently of the `context-mode` npm package."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"The plugin loads context-mode's engine library in-process (`build/server.js`\nof the dependency `cont"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ext-mode` package — the same module the OpenCode/Kilo\nnative adapter imports) and registers the `ctx"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"_*` tools natively into dsh's\n`tools` registry under their bare names — no MCP child process, no\n`mc"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"p__context-mode__` prefix. The engine is always taken from the original\nauthor's published npm packa"},{"id":"p4s5","text":"ge; this repo ships only the dsh adapter."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Contents"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| Path | Purpose |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| `index.js` | Plugin module (`name` / `inject` / `apply`), engine location + registration |\n| `cord"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"is.patch.yml` | dsh bundle patch (`insert` row id `context-mode`) |\n| `package.json` | npm metadata "},{"id":"p7s3","text":"+ `dsh.bundle.patch` manifest, depends on `context-mode` |\n| `scripts/dev-harness.mjs` | Engine-leve"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"l test: mock ctx, tool registration + FTS5 round trip |\n| `scripts/dev-boot-probe.mjs` | Real dsh pr"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"ofile boot probe (dsh-app-boot), tool catalog check |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## What you get"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| context-mode surface | dsh surface |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| `ctx_execute` / `ctx_execute_file` / `ctx_batch_execute` | native dsh tools (sandbox subprocess, o"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"nly printed output enters the conversation) |\n| `ctx_index` / `ctx_search` / `ctx_fetch_and_index` |"},{"id":"p10s3","text":" native dsh tools (persistent FTS5 knowledge base, BM25 search) |\n| `ctx_stats` / `ctx_doctor` / `ct"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"x_purge` / `ctx_insight` | native dsh tools |\n| SessionStart routing-block hook | `context-mode:rout"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"ing` system-prompt section (dsh has no hook channel; the section plus the tool schemas are the enfor"},{"id":"p10s6","text":"cement surface) |\n| session continuity (PreCompact/PostToolUse capture) | not wired — dsh has its ow"},{"id":"p10s7","text":"n session/compaction layers; use `ctx_index` explicitly for durable memory |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"All tools run the exact context-mode implementations, including security\nrouting (curl/wget/inline-f"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"etch blocking), the executor's language matrix, and\nthe FTS5 content store. Storage defaults to dsh'"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"s own home\n(`$DSH_HOME/context-mode`, i.e. `~/.dsh/context-mode`) so the knowledge base\nis per-harne"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"ss and never writes into another harness's config tree; set the\nplugin `storageDir` (or `CONTEXT_MOD"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"E_DIR`/config) to override."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Requirements: Node.js ≥ 22.5 and a running dsh profile. The `context-mode`\nengine package is a regul"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"ar dependency and is installed automatically; no\nbuild step is needed for this plugin (pure JS)."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"From GitHub (the canonical install):"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"From npm (once the `dsh-context-mode` package is published):"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"From a local checkout of this repo:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"> If you develop with this folder checked out *inside* a context-mode repo\n> clone (`dsh/` next to t"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"he engine root), build the engine first\n> (`npm run build` in the engine root) so the sibling layout"},{"id":"p20s3","text":" resolves; a\n> normal install never needs that."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Restart dsh web. Verify with `ctx stats` in a session, or:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Engine location order"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"1. `config.enginePath` (plugin config)\n2. `CONTEXT_MODE_ENGINE` env var\n3. the dependency `context-m"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"ode` package via Node resolution — the\n`context-mode/package.json` subpath export when upstream prov"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"ides it,\notherwise the package root resolved from its main entry by walking up to\nthe `context-mode`"},{"id":"p24s4","text":" package.json (works with the published package as of\n1.0.169, under npm flat/nested and pnpm store "},{"id":"p24s5","text":"layouts)\n4. sibling layout (`../build/server.js` — dev inside the context-mode repo only)"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"If none resolve, the plugin degrades to routing-only and logs a warning; it\nnever fails the dsh prof"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"esolve, the plugin degrades to routing-only and logs a warning; it\nnever fails the dsh profile boot."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"The plugin row id is `context-mode` (see `cordis.patch.yml`). Override\nper-profile in `$DSH_HOME/pro"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"files/<name>/cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- `index.js` resolves the engine via Node resolution first (dependency\n`context-mode`), then the sib"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"ling layout — the same code works published and\nin-repo.\n- `CONTEXT_MODE_EMBEDDED_PLUGIN_TOOLS=1` is"},{"id":"p30s3","text":" set around the engine import so\ncontext-mode skips its stdio transport boot and process-wide handle"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"rs\n(matching the OpenCode/Kilo in-process contract).\n- `scripts/dev-harness.mjs` runs the plugin aga"},{"id":"p30s5","text":"inst a mock ctx and proves the\nFTS5 `ctx_index` → `ctx_search` round trip; `scripts/dev-boot-probe.m"},{"id":"p30s6","text":"js`\nboots a real dsh profile and checks the registered tool catalog."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Credits"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"This plugin is an independent dsh adapter by **icanfinish11**. The engine it\nloads is **Context Mode"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"** by **Mert Koseoğlu**\n(mksglu): <https://github.com/mksglu/context-mode>, distributed on npm as\n`c"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"ontext-mode` under the Elastic License 2.0. The engine is consumed as a\nruntime dependency from the "},{"id":"p32s4","text":"original author's published package — it is not\nvendored or re-published here, and this repo contain"},{"id":"p32s5","text":" published package — it is not\nvendored or re-published here, and this repo contains no engine code."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
